  "slug": "pesticide-application-incident-report-form",
  "title": "Pesticide Application Incident Report Form",
  "subtitle": "Pesticide Application stabilize the event, preserve facts and affected identities, assess impact, assign corrective action, authorize disposition, and close the handoff.",
  "description": "An original, workflow-complete pesticide application incident report covering identity and routing, domain observations and evidence, accountable decisions, exceptions and escalation, and completion handoff without replacing qualified judgment.",
  "use_case": "Use after an unplanned event or material deviation to preserve evidence, keep affected work or product visible, and route decisions to accountable owners. The record is owned by the application program owner and closes only after evidence, exceptions, disposition, and the next accountable handoff are documented.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
