            "Emergency, exposure, or medical route was activated when indicated",
            "People were kept from the affected area under current directions",
            "Product container, label, and registration reference were preserved",
            "Weather, wind, equipment settings, and location were captured",
            "Potential drift, spill, contact, or wrong-site concern was escalated",
            "Field, crop, product lot, and affected area were placed on review hold",
            "Authorized management and applicable external contacts were notified"
